### Home
GET http://localhost:1198


### Register Admin
POST http://localhost:1198/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-registration-secret: {{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTRATION_SECRET}}

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ReplaceThisWithYourOwnPassphrase2026!"
}


### Login Admin
POST http://localhost:1198/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ReplaceThisWithYourOwnPassphrase2026!"
}


### Submit Contact Form (Public)
POST http://localhost:1198/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ashish",
  "email": "ashish@example.com",
  "subject": "Website inquiry",
  "message": "I would like to discuss a project for https://ashishranjan.in/."
}


### Get All Contact Submissions (Admin)
GET http://localhost:1198/api/contacts


### Get Single Contact Submission (Admin)
GET http://localhost:1198/api/contacts/PASTE_CONTACT_ID_HERE


### Update Contact Status (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:1198/api/contacts/PASTE_CONTACT_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "read"
}


### Delete Contact Submission (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:1198/api/contacts/PASTE_CONTACT_ID_HERE


### Logout Admin
POST http://localhost:1198/api/auth/logout
